  "description": "A .NET global tool and standalone executable that clones and renames entire projects in one step. Supports .NET 10 through .NET Framework 4.6.2. Performs case-aware find-and-replace across file contents, file names, and directory names — supporting PascalCase, camelCase, kebab-case, snake_case, dot.case and more. Handles .sln/.slnx GUID regeneration, UserSecretsId rotation, launchSettings port randomization, and automatic dotnet/npm/yarn/pnpm restore. Built for ABP.io, ASP.NET Core, Angular, React Native, and any multi-project .NET solution.",
